    <Name>INT_2020_0435</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0435","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>On why the canvas must stay blank</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0435","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2020-04-16</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0435","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Þóra Jovanović talks about how to hang a painting upside down on purpose. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
